                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d07ff32a-da6d-4a9b-91d8-5b85d3ea830a",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a720f39-c3cd-3072-8f50-588ed4b2d45a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1e21f4ec-2af1-3a6b-95ee-ed6063874ffc",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zerstörung der Umwelt",
                        "target_lang_word": "ecocide",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ecocide",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fe679d8-db16-3587-9f74-644709bb443d",
                                        "entry_id": "8c54ffd5-9bae-3b68-a7b6-c5ad5e1db665",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The complete destruction of an ecosystem due to human activities, such as due to exploitation of resources, nuclear warfare, or the dumping of harmful chemicals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c316bf6f-6f2d-4881-986a-7fde2691ef76",
                                                "sense_id": "7fe679d8-db16-3587-9f74-644709bb443d",
                                                "text": "Two common terms used to characterize injuries to the environment include “geocide” and “ecocide,” terms particularly applicable to rain forest damage because it is irreparable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54d93a13-77ff-40b9-88f4-934197dd9d72",
                                                "sense_id": "7fe679d8-db16-3587-9f74-644709bb443d",
                                                "text": "It has also been suggested that environmental crimes might include the proposed crime of ‘ecocide’ or ‘geocide’, with proponents of this view attempting to draw parallels between destructive acts towards the environment and those against the qualifying groups for genocide. […] [M]any who advocate for the creation of either ecocide or geocide principally argue that the best place to try such crimes is through an apparatus created in a separate and environment-oriented treaty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdc7ef78-aae3-435a-a13f-704ca26a70a4",
                                                "sense_id": "7fe679d8-db16-3587-9f74-644709bb443d",
                                                "text": "The funeral is the culmination of Extinction Rebellion’s actions at London fashion week. They also staged a die-in outside one of the show venues on Friday and a swarm outside Victoria Beckham’s show on Sunday, with protesters holding placards reading “fashion = ecocide” and “the ugly truth about fashion”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
